 * Renders one self-contained Tui page — no external CSS, fonts, or images.
 *
 * `lead`, `steps`, `hint`, `head`, and `tail` are trusted markup so copy can
 * carry `<code>` spans; the title is escaped. Escape request-derived text at the
 * call site.
